@archive 0009
@size 11

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"이게 재밍이구나…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"엄청난 노이즈야…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"우리는 노이즈에 내성이\n있으니까 여기서는 괜찮을\n거야."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"아마치 씨가 미소라랑\n곤타를 같이 못 오게 한\n것도 그 때문이겠지."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이렇게 가까이 있는 것만으로도\n두 사람은 큰 위험에 처할 테니까."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"그래.\n그럼 그 할머니는\n저 안 어딘가에 계신 거지?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하지만 전파 변환을 해도 저\n안으로 들어갈 수는\n없을 것 같아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"분명 방법이 있을 텐데…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"방법이 있을지도 모르지, 꼬맹이."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"무슨 뜻이야?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"네 몸이 노이즈에\n더 익숙해진 것 같아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그렇다면 나의 엄청난 힘으로\n노이즈를 일부 흩어 버릴\n수 있을지도 몰라."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 4 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"저, 정말!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"어디서나 통하는 건 아니야…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하지만 노이즈가 아주 약한\n곳이라면 어쩌면 가능할지도\n몰라!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = GeoAngry
	"좋은 작전이야!\n할 수 있어, 워록!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	end
}
